#> tool: sedrepl
#> wait: sunless sea.  :In Xanadu
#> pause: 50
#> must: In Xanadu did Kubla Khan  :In Xanadu
#> must: A stately pleasure dome decree:  :In Xanadu
#> must: Down to a sunless sea.  :In Xanadu
#> not: :In Xanadu did
#> source: 1x
# 17. The hold area: h, H, g, G and x. McMahon 3.5, the paper's own example
# h copies the pattern space into the hold area (H appends to it), g copies it
# back (G appends, newline between), x swaps the two. Line 1: h saves it, s cuts
# it to "In Xanadu", x swaps: the short form is held, the full line is back.
# Every line: G appends the held text and s turns the newline into "  :".
# Try: change G to g: every line becomes just the held text.
1h
1s/ did.*//
1x
G
s/\n/  :/

#DATA
In Xanadu did Kubla Khan
A stately pleasure dome decree:
Where Alph, the sacred river, ran
Through caverns measureless to man
Down to a sunless sea.
